{:edb/db-before-t 2283 :edb/db-after-t 2284 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535596 50 #inst "2026-10-09T03:13:38.542Z" 13194139535596 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186356748 13194139535596 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186356755 13194139535596 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186356762 13194139535596 true] [17592186068729 1020 #edb/ref 17592186356769 13194139535596 true] [17592186068729 1020 #edb/ref 17592186356772 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1017 #edb/ref 17592186356749 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1089 "q-114950" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1100 "Calculate $\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1113 #uuid "4c99d56a-1377-5ce5-b516-30c385b48d3f" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356748 1145 "To use integration by parts, let's suppose that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⇒\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-3{e}^{-3x}\\,, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-3x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(-3{e}^{-3x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3J.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we can use integration by parts to evaluate\n\n$$\nJ=\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTo do this, let's suppose that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⇒\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-3{e}^{-3x}\\,, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}J & =\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-3x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)(-3{e}^{-3x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\int {e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3I.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting this back into our equation for $I,$ we can subsequently solve for $I.$ We remember to add a constant of integration $C$ at the end.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3J \\\\ I & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3(-{e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3I) \\\\ I & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3{e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-9I \\\\ 10I & ={e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3{e}^{-3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ I & =\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{10}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356750 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356751 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356752 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356753 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356754 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1041 "selection" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356753 13194139535596 true] [17592186356749 1110 #uuid "042a3d3b-21c3-580b-b9e3-0da837e2365a" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356750 1034 "\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{10}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356750 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535596 true] [17592186356750 1111 #uuid "1c64b762-3594-5230-9187-4ade49f77b04" 13194139535596 true