{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{3x}(-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5})-\\int (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5})(3{e}^{3x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}\\int {e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}J.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we can use integration by parts to evaluate\n\n$$\nJ=\\int {e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTo do this, let's suppose that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={e}^{3x}\\, & ⇒\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{e}^{3x}\\,, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}J & =\\int {e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{3x}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})-\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})(3{e}^{3x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}\\int {e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}I.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting this back into our equation for $I,$ we can subsequently solve for $I.$ We remember to add a constant of integration $C$ at the end.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}J \\\\ I & =-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}(\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}I) \\\\ I & =-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{25}-\\frac{9}{25}I \\\\ \\frac{34}{25}I & =\\frac{3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-5{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{25} \\\\ I & =\\frac{{e}^{3x}(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x))}{34}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356757 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356758 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356759 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356760 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356761 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1041 "selection" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356759 13194139535596 true] [17592186356756 1110 #uuid "e284cfe5-d554-5487-a349-610fd8979757" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356757 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)-{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{34}+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356757 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535596 true] [17592186356757 1111 #uuid "185bbe98-9f84-509f-bc39-572b0ee53fc4" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356758 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)-3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)-3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{34}+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356758 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535596 true] [17592186356758 1111 #uuid "fc8c142d-dc77-5fc5-82fb-3a1a763a776b" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356759 1034 "\\frac{{e}^{3x}(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x))}{34}+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356759 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535596 true] [17592186356759 1111 #uuid "180b66e7-b823-5b42-ba6f-13d0fba0111a" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356760 1034 "\\frac{{e}^{3x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x))}{34}+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356760 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535596 true] [17592186356760 1111 #uuid "078965f0-0441-558a-8372-3920df2cacb4" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356761 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)+{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{34}+C" 13194139535596 true] [17592186356761 1103